# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Everything in this folder is deployed (there is no build step to leave
# things out), so the files that are not pages for people are told to stay
# out of search results instead.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy allows exactly what the page uses: its own
# files, Google Fonts (the stylesheet and the font files), data: images (the
# paper grain in style.css) and the one inline script in the <head> of
# index.html, by its hash. If you change that script by one character,
# recompute the hash or the browser will refuse it and the page falls back
# to its no-JS layout:
#   python3 -c "import re,hashlib,base64;s=open('index.html').read();print(base64.b64encode(hashlib.sha256(re.search(r'<script>(.*?)</script>',s,re.S).group(1).encode()).digest()).decode())"
# style-src-attr allows the style="--d: …" attributes that time the marks.
# There are no analytics, no cookies and no third-party scripts.
#
# The same policy covers tools/og-source.html (the source of the social
# preview image): its style and script are files beside it, not inline.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security: Pages only serves HTTPS; this tells browsers
# never to try plain HTTP for copilot.langx.io. If HSTS is also switched on
# for the langx.io zone in Cloudflare, keep the two settings the same.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-BShMw3eEEVAGG5poRjfPJOMTdRCtyEbfIrw0+Dv6wRU='; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; style-src-attr 'unsafe-inline'; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/404
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/404.html
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/tools/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# The pages.dev addresses, production and preview, stay out of search
# results; only copilot.langx.io is indexed.
https://:project.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
https://:version.:project.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
